<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Questions people ask</p>
  <h1>FAQ</h1>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <details class="faq-item" open>
      <summary>Is LearnLoop really free?</summary>
      <p>The skill exchange is free, always — you trade your time and expertise instead of money. Pro (&#8377;499/month) is optional, and unlocks structured professional courses plus extra visibility tools.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Do I need a skill to join?</summary>
      <p>No. You can join purely to learn on the Free plan, and offer help around the house or your time instead of a taught skill. Pro courses don't require you to teach anything in return.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Can I swap online instead of in person?</summary>
      <p>Yes — most categories support video-call sessions, and you can filter by "online only" while browsing mentors.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>How are mentors verified?</summary>
      <p>Free-exchange mentors build reputation through completed swaps and reviews. Pro mentors teaching Learn a New Skill courses are vetted professionals and carry a verified badge.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What's the difference between Browse Skills and Learn a New Skill?</summary>
      <p>Browse Skills is free, casual, peer-to-peer swapping. Learn a New Skill is a paid, structured curriculum taught by a working professional, aimed at a real, portfolio-ready outcome.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Will I get an email confirming my registration?</summary>
      <p>Yes — as soon as you join, you'll receive a confirmation email with your registration ID and the details you submitted.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
